id: og_bathhouse_c
name: Bathhouse III
description: Bathhouse. Pools stepping down one after another over the furnace that heats all of them, where the quiet route and the hot one are the same distance apart the whole way. Built as a municipal bathhouse; the boilers were banked and the pools were never drained.

